// Maintenance claims and intermediation: L. 581-1..10, L. 582-1/2,
// L. 583-2/4/5 (L. 583-1/3 - module 08; L. 584-1 - decree renvoi, no norm).
//
// DEONTIC MAP:
// - L. 581-1 "habilites" - fund liberty to help recovery.
// - L. 581-2/3/9 - subrogation/mandat/priorite: institutional statuses.
// - L. 581-4 - creancier liberty (renoncer), organisme liberty (suspendre).
// - L. 581-7/10 "delai de cinq jours ouvrables" - prefect deadline: jours
//   ouvrables need a business-day calendar section 85 (working-day roll),
//   which the package lacks: no figure derived (boundary); executable -
//   prohibition on pursuing after saisine (L. 581-10 para. 3).
// - L. 581-5 (frais fixes par decret) - figure boundary, rule follows.
// - L. 582-1 - intermediation: mise en oeuvre status (conditions a/b/c),
//   cessation defeaters (VII 1° deces, 2° fin-titre/pension, 3° nouveau
//   titre, 4° demande conjointe hors violences) + suspension hors-etat
//   status (final para., violence-based qualification excluded); II
//   penalite - amount <= BMAF by decree: figure boundary (BMAF),
//   structure - status.
// - L. 582-2 - titre executoire: status + nullite defeater + later-judgment
//   defeater; competent issuer (allocataire residence, creditor fallback);
//   parent duties (signaler changement, transmettre nouvel accord);
//   "n'est susceptible d'aucun recours" - recorded immunity without a
//   position (no appeal as a case fact).
// - L. 583-2 - avance liberty (fonds d'action sanitaire et sociale).
// - L. 583-4/5 - transmettre duties (IJ maladie; L. 582-2 contribution).

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.pf.core version "0.1.0";
